WEBVTT

00:01.280 --> 00:07.000
A few days later, an imperial decree was issued: at the hour of noon today, Yu Gong is to be executed.

00:16.000 --> 00:21.200
The Wutu hordes trample across our Central Plains! Our ancient northern capital lies in ashes!

00:21.560 --> 00:26.900
How dare our Sovereign Father indulge in cowardly complacency here in the south?! How can you be so utterly blind?!

00:27.000 --> 00:33.500
The aristocratic clans drown in decadence, the eldest prince trembles in cowardice, blind to the mountains of bones of our slaughtered kin!

00:34.240 --> 00:42.000
Today my mortal flesh is slain, but I crave no reincarnation! I shall gaze down upon you from the heavens!

00:42.360 --> 00:47.000
I shall become the roaring wind, the torrential rain, the cleaving thunderbolt—!

00:46.720 --> 00:48.200
Sever his tongue!

00:48.520 --> 00:52.000
—to blast open a bloody path for the armored legions of our northern expedition—!

00:55.920 --> 00:58.500
The hour has arrived... Behead him!

01:00.480 --> 01:02.500
Your Highness... turn away. Do not look.
